  "description": "Ahhh...The Romanceür. This is Ron's (Ultraromance) brain child. The 1\" threaded, lugged, disc brake bike, now offered in a rim brake version as well! The Romanceur is designed to be able to take you out for a couple day jaunt and bring everything you may need for a whimsical time, in style.\n\nThe current colors are Rootbeer (Disc Only) and Ultraviolet (Canti Only), once the others are gone, they're gone, we do not plan to re-do those colors at the moment.\n\nThis run (and this run only) Rootbeer Colored Disc Romeo has a dropout/derailleur hanger that's compatible with cassettes that are 10 speed or less only. Set it up with a double or triple to get the wide gear spread of your dreams. The Canti version can be set up with whatever gearing you want.\n\nThe Disc Romanceür can fit 26x2.3\" or 650bx48 tires with fenders. Without fenders you can go for 26x2.4\" or 27.5x2.2\".\n\nThe Disc version's rear brake has internal cable routing through the top tube, while the Canti version has two cable stops.\n\nFront and rear thru axles are included with the Disc model.\n\nThe Disc version is I.S. mount. Best set up with up to a 160mm rotor front and rear\n\n50cm- HPX 1\n\n52cm- HPX 1 or 2\n\n55cm- HPX 2\n\n58cm- HPX 2 or 3 (2 is more ideal)\n\n62cm- HPX 3\n\nHEADSET NOT INCLUDED\n\nHandmade in Taiwan using Reynolds 853 tubing\n\nFillet Brazed Ornate Lug Construction",
